{"3618780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Weird Island VR", "steam_appid": 3618780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ATTENTION! This game is a thesis project for audio spatialization! While it's currently focused solely on that, the research project will expand based on test results! Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up in a new world and explore its space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this interactive and exploratory experience, you find yourself in the center of a remote island surrounded by water and as you wander around you notice the clear separations around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The buildings are silent and in ruins, the vegetation sparse and peculiar, the birds look like space rockets...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also notice various ships on the horizon and sinister pillars disappeared around the island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just can't understand what could have gone wrong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parallel Multi-Control System!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between mouse and keyboard and controllers by simply picking them up, or use them both at the same time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Multi-Camera System!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between first-person, world, or vr views by simply pressing a button!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day-Night Cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live in the world as you go through the days and notice the changes in the sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let music that reflects the time of day, the area, and the environment accompany you on your adventure!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ATTENTION! This game is a thesis project for audio spatialization! While it's currently focused solely on that, the research project will expand based on test results! Thank you!</p><p 